      "id": "def4311b9fcd471bb8b668784e2e826c",
      "name": "plan-task",
      "description": "Placeholder: turn a request into a written task spec before any code is touched.",
      "when_to_use": "",
      "body": "Write the task spec before anything is implemented. A spec that nobody\ncan check is not a spec.\n\n1. Restate the request in one sentence. If you cannot, ask the user instead of guessing.\n2. List the acceptance criteria as observable checks (a command that passes, a\n   file that exists, a behaviour that changed). Vague criteria produce vague reviews.\n3. List what is explicitly out of scope. This is what stops the implementer from\n   wandering.\n4. Record the spec in the `TaskSpec` blackboard class, then hand off.\n\nDo not start implementing here. This step only produces the spec.",
      "config": {
        "kind": "procedural",
        "model": "inherit",
        "effort": null,
        "hooks": null,
        "argument_hint": null,
        "allowed_tools": [],
        "paths": null,
