      "description": "Placeholder: delegate the task spec to the implementer subagent.",
      "when_to_use": "",
      "body": "Delegate the work in `TaskSpec` to the implementer subagent.\n\n- Read `TaskSpec` first. If it is missing or has no acceptance criteria, go back\n  and write it — delegating an unwritten spec wastes a whole round.\n- If `ReviewFindings` exists, this is a follow-up round: pass the blocking items\n  along and tell the implementer to address those first.\n- Delegate once. Do not implement the change yourself in this context; that is\n  what the subagent is for.",
